Z||000006||Flamberge||11-03-2001||03:45 AM||||Cheever3000 thanks man! (And good to see a Houstonian here, I am a native myself...Spring Branch.)<P>Nashco, the white one is an 88GT... It had the Formula decals (and pinstripes) on there when I bought it. I have been meaning to ask the previous owner about that... (The VIN# and everything else indicates it is a GT...)<P>The blue one is a 86 SE, and the red one is an 85 SE. I am lucky in that I have never owned a "Duke."<P>(Here's a funny story, me and my circle of friends have adopted the term "Punching a Duke" to mean taking a dump.)  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR><P>------------------<BR>- Flamberge<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://flamberge.iwarp.com/Serra3sm.jpg"> ||||reg||7
